# Words after a lone year marker ("final de janeiro passado eu fui") that open
# the next clause, so the marker closes the year phrase before them. Subject
# pronouns and unstressed object pronouns (pronomes oblíquos átonos). Source:
# Cunha and Cintra, Nova Gramática do Português Contemporâneo, the chapter on
# personal pronouns. "o" and "a" are also an article and a preposition.
eu
ele
ela
nós
se
me
o
a
